          <attvalue for="1" value="theorem" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="Theorem 5.1" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="Theorem 5.1 follows from Lemma 2.3. Every bounded linear functional f defined on a subspace M of a normed space X can be extended to X preserving the norm." />
