          <attvalue for="1" value="definition" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="Definition 1.5" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="A function f: R^n -&gt; R is convex if f(tx + (1-t)y) &lt;= t f(x) + (1-t) f(y) for all t in [0,1]." />
