          <attvalue for="1" value="theorem" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="Theorem 7.1" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="Theorem 7.1 follows from Lemma 2.5. Under Slater's condition, x* is optimal if and only if there exist KKT multipliers satisfying primal and dual feasibility." />
